pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>08 Related Work</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Ninja（SEC'17 / TIFS'19）—— 同方向最接近的对手</strong></p>
  - elementId: highlight-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#DBEAFE"
  - elementId: highlight-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 1120, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Ninja 和 RV-MalTrace 都关注恶意软件分析，都强调低侵入/抗规避，但实现路径截然不同。</strong></p>
  - elementId: diff-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 175, 1160, 360]
    columnWidths: [0.22, 0.39, 0.39]
    rowHeights: [0.10, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.18]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "维度"}
        - content: {text: "Ninja"}
        - content: {text: "RV-MalTrace"}
      - - content: {text: "目标"}
        - content: {text: "ARM 透明 malware 分析/调试"}
        - content: {text: "RISC-V/Linux 行为语义证据链"}
      - - content: {text: "隔离机制"}
        - content: {text: "TrustZone 安全域（EL3 vs normal）"}
        - content: {text: "无安全域；RTL 旁路捕获"}
      - - content: {text: "Trace 源"}
        - content: {text: "ARM 标准 ETM packet（指令流）"}
        - content: {text: "自定义 committed behavior event schema"}
      - - content: {text: "系统修改"}
        - content: {text: "需定制 TrustZone 固件（ATF）"}
        - content: {text: "零修改任何系统软件"}
      - - content: {text: "分析方式"}
        - content: {text: "在线 trace + 人工 debug（GDB-like）"}
        - content: {text: "离线 trace 分析 + 自动化行为规则匹配"}
      - - content: {text: "威胁模型"}
        - content: {text: "面向 evasive + 部分 privileged malware"}
        - content: {text: "trusted kernel、user-mode malware-like"}
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>一句话</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>Ninja 是分析工具（trace + debug 供人工分析）</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>RV-MalTrace 是证据生成器（自动化行为规则匹配 + 审计证据链）</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: avoid-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 550, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEE2E2"
  - elementId: avoid-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 550, 1120, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$danger;"><strong>避免的说法</strong></span>：RV-MalTrace is transparent like Ninja. / RV-MalTrace can analyze privileged malware like Ninja. / RV-MalTrace achieves Ninja-level overhead.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>43</p>
